      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "The twenty seventh, okay, cause does that day what we could do is, I mean, we have, so basically, the packing and it would be a lower hourly rate on Sundays actually. But, yeah, the packing typically will take around the same amount of time as moving. So for a two bedroom place usually it's about three and a half to five and a half hours for each portion. With the two main crew. We do bill in the fifteen minute increments so you only pay for time that's used and then the only additional cost is the, is the packing supplies for a two bedroom that usually comes out to around $217 in boxes, paper tape et cetera. You do only get charged for what we use but so last time with the two man crew it was $4, I would probably added probably about an hour for the move there and the hourly rate on Sundays is $210.",
      "name": "Calvin Hughes",
      "time": "2026-09-23T13:46:31.568406",
